🔑 Auth URLs (Public)
Register: POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register

Verify OTP: POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/verify-otp

Login: POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login

Resend OTP: POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/resend-otp

🛡️ Protected URLs (Authorization)
User Profile: GET http://localhost:5000/api/user/profile

Admin Dashboard: GET http://localhost:5000/api/user/admin-dashboard
  